                <pb facs="0687" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg615"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5082/113.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé Janes.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-02-23"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Bacon informs Mr. Janes that the department appreciates the congratulations
                    of the Brazilian minister for foreign affairs, who is being cabled direct.</p>
            </div>
